1
00:00:00,133 --> 00:00:02,383
- What do you think?
- You proposed the experiment.

2
00:00:02,552 --> 00:00:04,972
(Leonard:)I think you should present
your findings first.

3
00:00:05,138 --> 00:00:06,678
(Lesley:)Fair enough.

4
00:00:06,848 --> 00:00:10,098
(Lesley:)On the plus side, it was a good kiss,
reasonable technique...

5
00:00:10,268 --> 00:00:11,848
(Lesley:)...no extraneous spittle.

6
00:00:13,146 --> 00:00:15,356
(Lesley:)On the other hand, no arousal.

7
00:00:16,524 --> 00:00:18,024
- None?
- None.

8
00:00:18,985 --> 00:00:20,195
(Leonard:)Ah.

9
00:00:21,571 --> 00:00:23,701
(Leonard:)Well, thank you for your time.

10
00:00:23,865 --> 00:00:25,535
(Penny:)- Thank you.
- Hmm.

11
00:00:29,704 --> 00:00:31,164
(Leonard:)None at all?

12
00:00:35,293 --> 00:00:41,253
(Howard:)Sheldon, if you were a robot
and I knew and you didn't...

13
00:00:42,925 --> 00:00:45,095
(Howard:)...would you want me to tell you?

14
00:00:46,512 --> 00:00:48,052
(Sheldon:)That depends.

15
00:00:48,222 --> 00:00:53,892
(Sheldon:)When I learn that I'm a robot,
will I be able to handle it?

16
00:00:55,146 --> 00:00:59,196
(Howard:)Maybe, although the history
of science fiction is not on your side.

